    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411640/extras/15ee4be0af5ae794c3c8112509b74bb5.avif?t=1754508839\" /></span><br><br>Demegraunt is a platformer with two characters and a rich interactive environment. Go through your journey together with a unique partner.<br><br>Explore levels, find useful items, deal with dangerous traps, and break through to your goals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411640/extras/737eeff133a90d07b1d3c72a1129e0b5.avif?t=1754508839\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Two heroes with different abilities.<br></li><li> The variety of interactive game entities.<br></li><li> Save your game whenever you want.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411640/extras/15ee4be0af5ae794c3c8112509b74bb5.avif?t=1754508839\" /></span><br><br>Demegraunt is a platformer with two characters and a rich interactive environment. Go through your journey together with a unique partner.<br><br>Explore levels, find useful items, deal with dangerous traps, and break through to your goals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411640/extras/737eeff133a90d07b1d3c72a1129e0b5.avif?t=1754508839\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Two heroes with different abilities.<br></li><li> The variety of interactive game entities.<br></li><li> Save your game whenever you want.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The two heroes are trying to escape from an abandoned planet after a shipwreck, breaking through the wild environment and automated security systems.",
